{"module":"grammar","item":{"id":"a2-grammar-wechselpraepositionen","level":"A2","topic":"Präpositionen","title":{"de":"Wechselpräpositionen: an, auf, über, unter, vor, hinter, neben, zwischen","bn":"দুই-দিকের Prepositions: Wo? না Wohin?"},"summary":"in-এর মতো আরও আটটি preposition: Wo? হলে Dativ, Wohin? হলে Akkusativ।","intro":[{"kind":"text","text":"আগে শিখেছ: in-এর পরে Wo? হলে Dativ, Wohin? হলে Akkusativ।"},{"kind":"text","text":"আরও আটটি preposition ঠিক একই নিয়মে চলে। এদের বলে Wechselpräpositionen (দুই-দিকের preposition)।"}],"sections":[{"heading":"১. নয়টি preposition","blocks":[{"kind":"table","rows":[["Preposition","বাংলা অর্থ"],["in","ভেতরে"],["an","গায়ে / ধারে (দেয়াল, জানালা)"],["auf","ওপরে (ছুঁয়ে)"],["über","ওপরে (না ছুঁয়ে)"],["unter","নিচে"],["vor","সামনে"],["hinter","পেছনে"],["neben","পাশে"],["zwischen","মাঝখানে"]]},{"kind":"text","text":"মনে রাখবে: Wo? (কোথায় আছে?) → Dativ। Wohin? (কোথায় যাচ্ছে / রাখছে?) → Akkusativ।"}]},{"heading":"২. Wo? → Dativ","blocks":[{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Das Buch liegt auf dem Tisch.","bn":"বইটি টেবিলের ওপর আছে।"},{"de":"Die Katze schläft unter dem Bett.","bn":"বিড়ালটি খাটের নিচে ঘুমাচ্ছে।"},{"de":"Das Bild hängt an der Wand.","bn":"ছবিটি দেয়ালে ঝুলছে।"},{"de":"Ich warte vor dem Kino.","bn":"আমি সিনেমা হলের সামনে অপেক্ষা করছি।"},{"de":"Die Bank ist zwischen der Post und dem Supermarkt.","bn":"ব্যাংকটি পোস্ট অফিস আর সুপারমার্কেটের মাঝখানে।"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"এখানে কোনো কিছু এক জায়গায় আছে, নড়ছে না। তাই dem, der (Dativ)।"}]},{"heading":"৩. Wohin? → Akkusativ","blocks":[{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Ich lege das Buch auf den Tisch.","bn":"আমি বইটি টেবিলের ওপর রাখছি।"},{"de":"Die Katze läuft unter das Bett.","bn":"বিড়ালটি দৌড়ে খাটের নিচে ঢুকছে।"},{"de":"Ich hänge das Bild an die Wand.","bn":"আমি ছবিটি দেয়ালে ঝোলাচ্ছি।"},{"de":"Wir gehen ins Kino.","bn":"আমরা সিনেমা দেখতে যাচ্ছি।"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"এখানে কোনো কিছু এক জায়গা থেকে আরেক জায়গায় যাচ্ছে। তাই den, die, das (Akkusativ)।"},{"kind":"table","rows":[["","Wo? (Dativ)","Wohin? (Akkusativ)"],["der Tisch","auf dem Tisch","auf den Tisch"],["die Wand","an der Wand","an die Wand"],["das Bett","unter dem Bett","unter das Bett"]]},{"kind":"text","text":"ছোট রূপ:"},{"kind":"list","items":["in + dem = im","in + das = ins","an + dem = am","an + das = ans"]}]}],"test":[{"id":"a2-grammar-wechselpraepositionen-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"Das Buch liegt auf ___ Tisch.","options":["den","dem","der"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Wo? → Dativ: der Tisch → dem Tisch।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-wechselpraepositionen-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich lege das Buch auf ___ Tisch.","options":["den","dem","des"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Wohin? → Akkusativ: den Tisch।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-wechselpraepositionen-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"Das Bild hängt an ___ Wand.","options":["die","der","den"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Wo? → Dativ: die Wand → der Wand।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-wechselpraepositionen-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"„unter“ মানে কী?","options":["ওপরে","নিচে","পাশে"],"answer":1,"explanation":"unter = নিচে।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-wechselpraepositionen-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"Wir gehen ___ Kino.","options":["im","ins","in dem"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Wohin? → Akkusativ: in das = ins।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-wechselpraepositionen-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"Wo? প্রশ্নের উত্তরে কোন case?","options":["Akkusativ","Dativ","Nominativ"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Wo? = অবস্থান → Dativ।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-wechselpraepositionen-t7","type":"mcq","prompt":"„zwischen“ মানে কী?","options":["মাঝখানে","সামনে","পেছনে"],"answer":0,"explanation":"zwischen = মাঝখানে।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-wechselpraepositionen-t8","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich warte ___ dem Kino. (সামনে)","options":["hinter","vor","über"],"answer":1,"explanation":"vor = সামনে।"}]},"schema":1,"id":"a2-grammar-wechselpraepositionen","level":"A2","test":[{"id":"a2-grammar-wechselpraepositionen-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"Das Buch liegt auf ___ Tisch.","options":["den","dem","der"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Wo? → Dativ: der Tisch → dem Tisch।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-wechselpraepositionen-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich lege das Buch auf ___ Tisch.","options":["den","dem","des"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Wohin? → Akkusativ: den Tisch।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-wechselpraepositionen-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"Das Bild hängt an ___ Wand.","options":["die","der","den"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Wo? → Dativ: die Wand → der Wand।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-wechselpraepositionen-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"„unter“ মানে কী?","options":["ওপরে","নিচে","পাশে"],"answer":1,"explanation":"unter = নিচে।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-wechselpraepositionen-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"Wir gehen ___ Kino.","options":["im","ins","in dem"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Wohin? → Akkusativ: in das = ins।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-wechselpraepositionen-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"Wo? প্রশ্নের উত্তরে কোন case?","options":["Akkusativ","Dativ","Nominativ"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Wo? = অবস্থান → Dativ।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-wechselpraepositionen-t7","type":"mcq","prompt":"„zwischen“ মানে কী?","options":["মাঝখানে","সামনে","পেছনে"],"answer":0,"explanation":"zwischen = মাঝখানে।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-wechselpraepositionen-t8","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich warte ___ dem Kino. (সামনে)","options":["hinter","vor","über"],"answer":1,"explanation":"vor = সামনে।"}]}